1
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Never stab the devil in the back!

2
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:16,000
John Wick: Chapter 2 is a action, thriller, crime
film directed by Chad Stahelski.

3
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:21,000
John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to
seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild.

4
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle
against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.

5
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:31,000
John Wick, played by Keanu Reeves.

6
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:36,000
Cassian, played by Common.

7
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:41,000
Bowery King, played by Laurence Fishburne.

8
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:46,000
Santino D'Antonio, played by Riccardo Scamarcio.

9
00:45:45,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Ares, played by Ruby Rose.

10
00:50:50,000 --> 00:50:56,000
Charon, played by Lance Reddick.

11
00:55:55,000 --> 00:56:01,000
John Wick: Chapter 2 is a 2017 American neo-noir action thriller film
directed by Chad Stahelski and written by Derek Kolstad.

12
01:01:00,000 --> 01:01:06,000
As the direct sequel to John Wick (2014), it is the second
installment in the John Wick film series.

13
01:06:05,000 --> 01:06:11,000
The film stars Keanu Reeves as the title character, with a supporting cast of Common, Laurence Fishburne, Riccardo
Scamarcio, Ruby Rose, Lance Reddick, Peter Stormare, Bridget Moynahan, Franco Nero, John Leguizamo, and Ian McShane.

14
01:11:10,000 --> 01:11:16,000
The film's plot follows retired hitman John Wick (Reeves) as he is forced back into his old
life to fulfill a blood oath to crime lord Santino D'Antonio (Scamarcio).

15
01:16:15,000 --> 01:16:21,000
Following the box office success of the previous film, Stahelski and the first film's uncredited
co-director David Leitch said a sequel film began development in February 2015.

16
01:21:20,000 --> 01:21:26,000
Later that same month, Jon Feltheimer confirmed plans for additional John Wick properties to create a
media franchise, and announced the return of Kolstad as the sequel's screenwriter.

17
01:26:25,000 --> 01:26:31,000
Principal photography began in October 2015 and lasted until early that following year,
with filming taking place in Montreal, New Jersey, New York City, and Rome.

18
01:31:30,000 --> 01:31:36,000
John Wick: Chapter 2 had its premiere at the Arclight Hollywood in Los Angeles on January
30, 2017, and was released by Lionsgate in the United States on February 10.

19
01:36:35,000 --> 01:36:41,000
The film received acclaim from critics, with praise for the action sequences, direction,
editing, visual style, and the performances of the cast, particularly Reeves.

20
01:41:40,000 --> 01:41:46,000
It grossed US$174.3 million worldwide, becoming the
then-highest grossing film in the franchise.

21
01:46:45,000 --> 01:46:51,000
A sequel, John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum, was released in May 2019.

22
01:51:50,000 --> 01:51:56,000
The film explores themes of martial arts, assassin, hitman, italy, roof.

23
01:56:55,000 --> 01:57:01,000
The tone is dark and intense.
